---
diff --git a/chrome/browser/ui/webui/dashboard/TIP_SYNC_3158.md b/chrome/browser/ui/webui/dashboard/TIP_SYNC_3158.md
new file mode 100644
--- /dev/null
+++ b/chrome/browser/ui/webui/dashboard/TIP_SYNC_3158.md
@@ -0,0 +1,18 @@
+# 3158 — Request action + traffic capture
+
+## Summary
+- New `request` action: page-context fetch with credentials
+- CDP Network ring buffer while recording
+- Traffic panel promote-to-step with optional secret token rewrite
+
+## Apply
+Use full-file overlay (preferred):
+
+```
+rsync -a overlays/3158/chrome/ "$CHROMIUM_SRC/chrome/"
+```
+
+See overlays/3158/APPLY.txt.
